# M9 online UI (scripts/net/m9-online-ui.sh): main menu -> online -> player
# name entry -> room list (a public room hosted by a --net-peer) -> join ->
# lobby -> a box joins -> back to the menu.
60 shot 01-menu
8 press km down
8 press km accept             # online
40 shot 02-online-menu
8 press km down
8 press km down
8 press km down
8 press km down               # name
8 press km accept
10 type bopl tester
20 shot 03-name-typing
5 key Return
20 shot 04-name-set
8 press km up                 # room list
8 press km accept
300 shot 05-rooms
8 press km accept             # the first room
0 wait machines 2
90 shot 06-lobby
8 key Return                  # keyboard + mouse joins a box
40 shot 07-lobby-joined
8 key Escape                  # leave the box
20 key Escape                 # leave the room
0 wait menu
40 shot 08-menu-back
20 quit
